---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; const posts=(await getCollection('writeups',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.date.valueOf()-a.data.date.valueOf());
---
<Base title="Write-ups | 박현석"><section class="wrap page"><div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICE</p><h1>Write-ups<span class="accent">.</span></h1><p>실습과 문제 풀이에서 배운 개념을 기록합니다.</p></div><div class="related-link"><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">기술 블로그 보기</a></div><div class="category-strip"><span>WebGoat</span><span>TryHackMe</span><span>CTF</span><span>기타 실습</span></div><div class="section-rule"><span>전체 풀이</span><span>{posts.length} 개 글</span></div>{posts.length ? <div class="article-list">{posts.map(post=><article class="article-card"><div class="article-meta"><span>{post.data.platform} · {post.data.difficulty}</span><time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{post.data.date.toLocaleDateString('ko-KR',{timeZone:'UTC'})}</time></div><h3><a href={`/writeups/${post.id}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h3><p>{post.data.field} · {post.data.concepts.join(', ')}</p><div class="tags">{post.data.tags.map(t=><span>#{t}</span>)}</div></article>)}</div> : <div class="empty"><div><strong>아직 공개된 풀이가 없습니다.</strong><p>실습 내용이 준비되면 이곳에 추가할 예정입니다.</p></div></div>}</section></Base>
